408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Jobs-To-Be-Done \(JTBD\) framework ensures that the proposed features directly address the real safety concerns of solo travelers, particularly women. By focusing on practical, user-driven solutions, the product creates a comprehensive safety ecosystem that spans trip planning, navigation, emergency support, and digital security. Integrating real-time alerts, AI-driven risk analysis, and verified community networks enhances trust and usability. This approach not only improves user adoption but also empowers travelers with reliable information and immediate support, ultimately making solo travel safer and more accessible.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
